`define CORE_INFO "I,Finishing move set: it plays\nat the next FINISH HIM,Not this fighter's FINISH HIM:\nthe move waits for a later one,Too far: step closer,Too close: step back,Stage move: The Pit II\nand Kombat Tomb only,Stage move: The Pit II only,Dead Pool only,FINISH HIM is over: the move\nwaits for the next one,Move not taken,Not taken: a Friendship or\nBabality needs a round won\nwithout punches,Finishing move cleared,Not taken: stage move for\nKombat Tomb / The Pit II /\nYoteigai Tor / Pit (MK1),Security Screen on: it starts\neach attract cycle,Hitboxes on: shown in fights,Pong on: it follows the first\nround of a 2-player battle,Noob Saibot on: the winner of\nthe first round of a 2-player\nbattle fights him,Jade on: the first round you\nwin in a 1-player game is\nfollowed by her fight,Smoke on: hold Down and press\nStart in a fight,Code entered,Code not taken: codes work\nin the attract mode,On for all players,On for all players from the\nnext game,Code not taken: pick it on\nTonight's Match-Up,Reptile fight set: win a match\nin a 1-player game,Reptile fight cleared,Moon Silhouettes on: every\nmatch on The Pit has them,Reptile Hints on: he drops in\nbefore every round,Attract Sound: Always On,Attract Sound: Default;"

// The Character option of rev 4.0 (g = 1) and Plus (g = 2) lists its fighters alphabetically; each one's line is
// his number in the page's lines (the fighters of Mortal Kombat II keep theirs, the hidden ones follow). The
// others: the option is the line.
function automatic [4:0] fm_pick(input [1:0] g, input [4:0] opt);
	case ({g, opt})
		{2'd1, 5'd1}: fm_pick = 5'd12;   // Ermac
		{2'd1, 5'd2}: fm_pick = 5'd13;   // Jade
		{2'd1, 5'd3}: fm_pick = 5'd1;   // Jax
		{2'd1, 5'd4}: fm_pick = 5'd2;   // Johnny Cage
		{2'd1, 5'd5}: fm_pick = 5'd3;   // Kitana
		{2'd1, 5'd6}: fm_pick = 5'd4;   // Kung Lao
		{2'd1, 5'd7}: fm_pick = 5'd5;   // Liu Kang
		{2'd1, 5'd8}: fm_pick = 5'd6;   // Mileena
		{2'd1, 5'd9}: fm_pick = 5'd7;   // Raiden
		{2'd1, 5'd10}: fm_pick = 5'd14;   // Rain
		{2'd1, 5'd11}: fm_pick = 5'd8;   // Reptile
		{2'd1, 5'd12}: fm_pick = 5'd9;   // Scorpion
		{2'd1, 5'd13}: fm_pick = 5'd10;   // Shang Tsung
		{2'd1, 5'd14}: fm_pick = 5'd11;   // Sub-Zero
		{2'd2, 5'd1}: fm_pick = 5'd12;   // Jade
		{2'd2, 5'd2}: fm_pick = 5'd1;   // Jax
		{2'd2, 5'd3}: fm_pick = 5'd2;   // Johnny Cage
		{2'd2, 5'd4}: fm_pick = 5'd13;   // Kintaro
		{2'd2, 5'd5}: fm_pick = 5'd3;   // Kitana
		{2'd2, 5'd6}: fm_pick = 5'd4;   // Kung Lao
		{2'd2, 5'd7}: fm_pick = 5'd5;   // Liu Kang
		{2'd2, 5'd8}: fm_pick = 5'd6;   // Mileena
		{2'd2, 5'd9}: fm_pick = 5'd14;   // Noob Saibot
		{2'd2, 5'd10}: fm_pick = 5'd7;   // Raiden
		{2'd2, 5'd11}: fm_pick = 5'd8;   // Reptile
		{2'd2, 5'd12}: fm_pick = 5'd9;   // Scorpion
		{2'd2, 5'd13}: fm_pick = 5'd10;   // Shang Tsung
		{2'd2, 5'd14}: fm_pick = 5'd15;   // Shao Kahn
		{2'd2, 5'd15}: fm_pick = 5'd16;   // Smoke
		{2'd2, 5'd16}: fm_pick = 5'd11;   // Sub-Zero
		default: fm_pick = opt;
	endcase
endfunction

